WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[109644] = "Use: Attempts to assemble Walter, the world's laziest waiter and butler, who might help out for up to 6 min.\n\nWalter can begrudgingly grant bank access to his creator.  For everyone else, he sells some fairly terrible food. (2 Hr Cooldown)"
