WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111981] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Gladiator's Sanctum building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nIncreases your out-of-combat regeneration in outdoor Draenor zones and allows the collection of broken bones from defeated enemy players (used for Conqueror's Tribute).\n\nLevel 2\nEnables safe fall and underwater breathing in outdoor Draenor zones.  Also enables the Nemesis quest series for defeating enemy players of specific races.\n\nLevel 3\nWhile below 35% life, all damage taken is reduced by 50% in outdoor Draenor zones.  Grants access to the Highmaul Coliseum gladiator tournament.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111982] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Storehouse building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nEnables access to your personal bank and increases the total number of active work orders for all buildings by 5.\n\nLevel 2\nEnables access to your guild bank.\n\nLevel 3\nEnables access to an Ethereal Trader for Void Storage and Transmogrification and increases the total number of active work orders for all buildings by 15.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111983] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Storehouse building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nEnables access to your personal bank and increases the total number of active work orders for all buildings by 5.\n\nLevel 2\nEnables access to your guild bank.\n\nLevel 3\nEnables access to an Ethereal Trader for Void Storage and Transmogrification and increases the total number of active work orders for all buildings by 15.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111984] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Gnomish Gearworks building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nUnlocks a personal engineer that creates a powerful invention each day. Exceptional work!\n\nLevel 2\nYour engineer gains access to five new and amazing devices.\n\nLevel 3\nAllows the creation of a siege vehicle once per day. Drive it to victory in Draenor!\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111985] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Gnomish Gearworks building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nUnlocks a personal engineer that creates a powerful invention each day. Exceptional work!\n\nLevel 2\nYour engineer gains access to five new and amazing devices.\n\nLevel 3\nAllows the creation of a siege vehicle once per day. Drive it to victory in Draenor!\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111986] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Trading Post building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nA merchant shows up each day selling trade goods.  Also allows the trade of crafting reagents for garrison resources.\n\nLevel 2\nGrants access to the Sha'tari Defense or Laughing Skull factions. Also unlocks the ability to acquire parts from around Draenor to build an auctioneer.\n\nLevel 3\nIncreases reputation gain in Draenor by 20%.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111987] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Trading Post building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nA merchant shows up each day selling trade goods.  Also allows the trade of crafting reagents for garrison resources.\n\nLevel 2\nGrants access to the Sha'tari Defense or Laughing Skull factions. Also unlocks the ability to acquire parts from around Draenor to build an auctioneer.\n\nLevel 3\nIncreases reputation gain in Draenor by 20%.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111988] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Tannery building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows the production of Leatherworking items and work orders.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Leatherworking trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks Leatherworking missions, and allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111989] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Tannery building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows the production of Leatherworking items and work orders.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Leatherworking trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks Leatherworking missions, and allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111990] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade The Forge building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows the production of Blacksmithing items and work orders.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Blacksmithing trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks Blacksmithing missions, and allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111991] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade the Forge building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows the production of Blacksmithing items and work orders.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Blacksmithing trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks Blacksmithing missions, and allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111992] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Tailoring Emporium building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows the production of Tailoring items and work orders.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Tailoring trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks Tailoring missions, and allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111993] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Tailoring Emporium building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows the production of Tailoring items and work orders.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Tailoring trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks Tailoring missions, and allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111996] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Lunarfall Excavation to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows players to mine Draenic Stone from mineral nodes in Draenor. Draenic Stone can be converted to work orders for Draenor minerals.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Mining trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also opens a new mineshaft, granting access to additional mining nodes and allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nA final mineshaft allows access to rich mining nodes.  In addition, garrison guards will patrol your mine, keeping it clear of hostile goren. Also allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111997] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Herb Garden to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nGrows Draenic Seeds into herbs each day and herbalism nodes are available in the garden.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Herbalism trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also increases the amount of herbs that can be harvested at the garden and allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nGrow a unique Draenor fruit tree in your garden that grants food buffs. Also allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111998] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Menagerie building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nAttracts elite pets you can battle for rewards.  Also lets 5 of your battle pets hang out in your garrison.\n\nLevel 2\nIncreases your trap chance and reduces the cooldown of Revive Battle Pets while in Draenor.  Up to 10 of your pets can now hang out in your garrison.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks a pet battle daily with unique pet rewards.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[111999] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Menagerie building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nAttracts elite pets you can battle for rewards.  Also lets 5 of your battle pets hang out in your garrison.\n\nLevel 2\nIncreases your trap chance and reduces the cooldown of Revive Battle Pets while in Draenor.  Up to 10 of your pets can now hang out in your garrison.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks a pet battle daily with unique pet rewards.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[112001] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to build a Stables building in your Garrison.\n\nLevel 1\nEnables the capture and training of special mounts on Draenor.  Also allows you remain mounted while interacting with objects in outdoor Draenor zones.\n\nLevel 2\nYou will no longer get dazed by enemies while riding mounts in outdoor Draenor zones.\n\nLevel 3\nIncreases mount speed in Draenor by 20%.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[112002] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Stables building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nEnables the capture and training of special mounts on Draenor.  Also allows you remain mounted while interacting with objects in outdoor Draenor zones.\n\nLevel 2\nYou will no longer get dazed by enemies while riding mounts in outdoor Draenor zones.\n\nLevel 3\nIncreases mount speed in Draenor by 20%.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
