WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116184] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to build a War Mill building in your Garrison.\n\nLevel 1\nDoubles the chance for your quest rewards to get a rare or epic Bonus Upgrade, and increases the potency of the upgrade. Allows the collection of armor scraps from the orc clans of Draenor for armor transmogrification use.\n\nLevel 2\nOpens up work orders for follower weapons and armor in exchange for garrison resources.  Also, new armor transmogrification items unlock.\n\nLevel 3\nGrants 1 of your 3 seals of inevitable fate (raid bonus loot roll) at no cost each week.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116185] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your War Mill building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nDoubles the chance for your quest rewards to get a rare or epic Bonus Upgrade, and increases the potency of the upgrade. Allows the collection of armor scraps from the orc clans of Draenor for armor transmogrification use.\n\nLevel 2\nOpens up work orders for follower weapons and armor in exchange for garrison resources.  Also, new armor transmogrification items unlock.\n\nLevel 3\nGrants 1 of your 3 seals of inevitable fate (raid bonus loot roll) at no cost each week.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116186] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your War Mill building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nDoubles the chance for your quest rewards to get a rare or epic Bonus Upgrade, and increases the potency of the upgrade. Allows the collection of armor scraps from the orc clans of Draenor for armor transmogrification use.\n\nLevel 2\nOpens up work orders for follower weapons and armor in exchange for garrison resources.  Also, new armor transmogrification items unlock.\n\nLevel 3\nGrants 1 of your 3 seals of inevitable fate (raid bonus loot roll) at no cost each week.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116196] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Spirit Lodge building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows the collection of Ogre Waystones from Ogres on Draenor.  These waystones can be used to power an Ogre Waygate of your choice on Draenor.  Also occasionally triggers Runes of Power during combat.\n\nLevel 2\nUnlocks access to a second Ogre Waygate for a total of 2.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks access to a third Ogre Waygate for a total of 3.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116197] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Spirit Lodge building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows the collection of Ogre Waystones from Ogres on Draenor.  These waystones can be used to power an Ogre Waygate of your choice on Draenor.  Also occasionally triggers Runes of Power during combat.\n\nLevel 2\nUnlocks access to a second Ogre Waygate for a total of 2.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks access to a third Ogre Waygate for a total of 3.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116198] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to build a Spirit Lodge building in your Garrison.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows the collection of Ogre Waystones from Ogres on Draenor.  These waystones can be used to power an Ogre Waygate of your choice on Draenor.  Also occasionally triggers Runes of Power during combat.\n\nLevel 2\nUnlocks access to a second Ogre Waygate for a total of 2.\n\nLevel 3\nUnlocks access to a third Ogre Waygate for a total of 3.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116199] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to build a Goblin Workshop building in your Garrison.\n\nLevel 1\nUnlocks a personal engineer that creates a powerful invention each day. Exceptional work!\n\nLevel 2\nYour engineer gains access to five new and amazing devices.\n\nLevel 3\nAllows the creation of a siege vehicle once per day. Drive it to victory in Draenor!\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116200] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Goblin Workshop building to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nUnlocks a personal engineer that creates a powerful invention each day. Exceptional work!\n\nLevel 2\nYour engineer gains access to five new and amazing devices.\n\nLevel 3\nAllows the creation of a siege vehicle once per day. Drive it to victory in Draenor!\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116201] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Goblin Workshop building to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nUnlocks a personal engineer that creates a powerful invention each day. Exceptional work!\n\nLevel 2\nYour engineer gains access to five new and amazing devices.\n\nLevel 3\nAllows the creation of a siege vehicle once per day. Drive it to victory in Draenor!\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116246] = "Use: Carefully remove the hide from Wooly Clefthoofs."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116247] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to build the Frostwall Mines.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows players to mine Draenic Stone from mineral nodes in Draenor. Draenic Stone can be converted to work orders for Draenor minerals.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Mining trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also opens a new mineshaft, granting access to additional mining nodes and allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nA final mineshaft allows access to rich mining nodes.  In addition, garrison guards will patrol your mine, keeping it clear of hostile goren. Also allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116248] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Frostwall Mines to level 2.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows players to mine Draenic Stone from mineral nodes in Draenor. Draenic Stone can be converted to work orders for Draenor minerals.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Mining trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also opens a new mineshaft, granting access to additional mining nodes and allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nA final mineshaft allows access to rich mining nodes.  In addition, garrison guards will patrol your mine, keeping it clear of hostile goren. Also allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[116249] = "Use: Provides the plans needed to upgrade your Frostwall Mines to level 3.\n\nLevel 1\nAllows players to mine Draenic Stone from mineral nodes in Draenor. Draenic Stone can be converted to work orders for Draenor minerals.\n\nLevel 2\nAllows followers with the Mining trait to work here, granting a unique bonus.  Also opens a new mineshaft, granting access to additional mining nodes and allows up to 14 work orders at one time.\n\nLevel 3\nA final mineshaft allows access to rich mining nodes.  In addition, garrison guards will patrol your mine, keeping it clear of hostile goren. Also allows up to 21 work orders at one time.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
