WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[147496] = "Regenerates 10% of maximum health every 2 sec while not in combat. \n\nGrants a connection to the Fel Heart of Argus that allows you to be brought back to life should you take fatal damage and knocks back enemies and stuns them for 5 sec. \n\nCannot be protected from fatal damage more than once per 30 min.\n\nCan only be used on Argus."
