WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[152093] = "Equip: Your melee attacks have a chance to grant an Echo of Gorshalach. On reaching 15 applications, you lash out with a devastating combination of attacks, critically striking enemies in a 15 yd cone in front of you for 323 Fire damage."
